      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `d75b81f86289bcd75b4b5b12842757d1dcc9dfecfa17fd8ffa4a824128e6be7f--employee-earnings-and-hours-australia-2025-cube-6-source.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Employee Earnings and Hours, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: May 2025\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 7 of 7\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 88740db80730e867b0d4671d0259a1057993c7825a6c079db551c1bb49e3e9c9 | missing |\n| \"Table_1\" | 3bde9e16d6a7fc2af6d6021486388d3c3a11aa3781175ab673ec5b3496097718 | missing |\n| \"Table_2\" | 114d257c37f981948a71ded8eace35d20675bbaba16b37ae6170562c3e789b6f | missing |\n| \"Table_3\" | df0017f1b5fbc207d89855b205f7fd5fb562fe5f833ca67afa2c893ab24e54f6 | missing |\n| \"Table_4\" | 9ff3e9d7e2a1e55f11b2b8ccaaf8504753f585be9256976d065ef3072c9e014a | missing |\n| \"Table_5\" | 3f4b117c82e063bca1f15a419affff12c9e212ae198fed8ad5de461edc66554f | missing |\n| \"Table_6\" | bff212c45f9a1b04c40b49bc990234a012d8aa19cba11ca35550bb9e29484935 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
